 "caption_en": "Every country has a red box. Which one would you invest in?\n\nA SWOT analysis (Strengths, Weaknesses, Opportunities, Threats) is what companies run before a big decision. Here it is for 7 countries, one item per box:\n\n🇮🇱 Israel: R&D at 6.8% of GDP, highest in the OECD (OECD MSTI, 2024 data) | cost of living | Abraham Accords (2020) | Iran's proxies\n🇸🇦 Saudi Arabia: 2nd largest proven oil reserves (OPEC) | a budget that leans on oil | Vision 2030 | cheap oil\n🇪🇬 Egypt: the Suez Canal | heavy debt, IMF programme | record tourism | Houthi attacks cut canal income from $10.25B (2023) to $4.0B (2024) (Suez Canal Authority)\n🇮🇷 Iran: 2nd largest gas reserves (Energy Institute) | inflation above 50% (Statistical Centre of Iran, 2026) | a young, educated population | a regime facing unrest\n🇷🇺 Russia: energy and the largest nuclear arsenal (FAS, 2025) | a commodity economy | Arctic sea routes | the cost of war and sanctions\n🇨🇳 China: about 30% of world manufacturing (UNIDO) | a shrinking population (NBS) | the lead in EVs and solar (IEA) | trade wars\n🇺🇸 US: innovation and the dollar (IMF COFER) | $40 trillion of debt (US Treasury, Aug 2026) | the lead in AI (Stanford AI Index) | polarisation (Pew)\n\nNo country is all green. What counts is what it does next.\n\nPhotos (Wikimedia Commons): PikiWiki Israel (CC BY 2.5); B.alotaby (CC BY-SA 4.0); Aah-Yeah (CC BY 2.0); Salehi1990mohsen (CC BY-SA 4.0); Vyacheslav Argenberg (CC BY 4.0); King of Hearts (CC BY-SA 4.0); USCapitol (public domain). AI voice.",
 "caption_he": "ניתוח SWOT ל־7 מדינות, פריט אחד בכל משבצת: חוזקה, חולשה, הזדמנות, איום.\nישראל: מו\"פ 6.8% מהתוצר, הגבוה ב־OECD | יוקר המחיה | הסכמי אברהם | שלוחי איראן.\nאף מדינה לא ירוקה לגמרי. מה שקובע זה מה היא עושה עם זה. במי הייתם משקיעים?",
